statement:
Canonical derived open restriction and its representative normalization. For every commutative condensed coefficient ring Λ and schemes and maps as in the following Lean statement, {X Y X' Y' : Scheme.{u}} {f : X ⟶ Y} {j : Y' ⟶ Y}
    {f' : X' ⟶ Y'} {i : X' ⟶ X} [IsOpenImmersion j] [IsOpenImmersion i]
    (sq : IsPullback i f' f j) : DirectImageRestrictionNormalized Λ sq.toCommSq. The canonical maps and predicates are those of [def-sfb-derived-direct-image-open-coherence-data].
